{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/537000/extras/4b00c1f1c2363a297d75b7f3fd8c4b79.avif?t=1546889215\" width=616 height=298 /></span><br><br>Nelo is the lightning fast, out of this world, genre-blending, bullet-hell, character-action epic meticulously crafted by the loving couple at Magic &amp; Mirrors. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/537000/extras/f6bd7bdc116dbdbaadd65d93b0da5321.avif?t=1546889215\" width=616 height=222 /></span><br><br>Play as Nelo Aukal, an advanced Zenith class alien cyborg of the Tono Gian people, and wield a vast array of weaponry with the trusted telekinetic Hands of Aphelion. Fight your way off the desolate planet Plemniba from the hostile threat of the Nightsithe, a swarm of parasitic machines created by your people. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/537000/extras/587e4b9f7f1c573463f1c0c063a5844a.avif?t=1546889215\" width=616 height=222 /></span><br><br>Master the reflex demanding skills of the powerful intergalactic Zenith Warrior with deep, mind-bending, breakneck gameplay that hybrids mechanics of twinstick shoot em\u2019 ups, gravity defying run and gun, and brutal hack n\u2019 slash melee combat. You will need these skills to survive the hostile world of Plemniba as being behind the enemy lines of the Nightsithe will not be easy even with your advanced alien technology.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"bfc47b5fabbe1543fac84befaa45e9ac5f18129f.jpg","localized_name":"Who's up 4 Shmups?!","name":"Who's up 4 Shmups?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/537000/bfc47b5fabbe1543fac84befaa45e9ac5f18129f.jpg"},{"icon":"5530e18ec4dbae4767dbe74fc6bb42bace7b031c.jpg","localized_name":"What's his Power Lev